Description:

Conversation subjects are now NFKC-normalized, so replies join their
conversation when the reply prefix uses compatibility forms such as the
CJK full-width colon or ideographic space, as in "回复：foo".  A space
before the colon, as in French "RE : foo", is now also accepted.


Documentation:

None.


Config changes:

None.


Upgrade instructions:

None.  Existing conversations keep matching new messages as before, and
also accept the new forms.  Conversation records written by this version
can't be read by older versions.


